  "content": "<p><strong>This texture pack brings the </strong><strong style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/quark\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Quark</a></strong><strong> aesthetic into&nbsp;</strong><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sophisticated-storage\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sophisticated Storage [FORGE]</a>/<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sophisticated-storage-unofficial-fabric-port\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[FABRIC</a>]</strong><strong>, giving its chests a more cohesive and stylish look. It is designed purely for visual compatibility, ensuring that both mods feel naturally integrated.</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Wooden chests of different types</strong></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">(Dark Oak, Cherry, Spruce, Birch, Jungle, Acacia, Crimson, Warped, Oak, Mangrove)</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Before</strong></span></h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1401547/description_e4ed383d-be8c-457d-8474-4c1a1f665126.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"359\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>After</strong></span></h3>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1401547/description_7c22bdcb-4788-481c-bb5c-ba6fa50bd382.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"359\"></strong></p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Wooden chests of different colors</strong></h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Before</strong></span></h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1401547/description_3020ff3a-9e77-43b2-9794-021538869130.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"359\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>After</strong></span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1401547/description_930629d0-2819-4fd3-aa87-7ca338205b13.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"359\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><strong>Credits &amp; License</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Original textures and inspiration: <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/quark\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Quark</a> by <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/vazkii/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Vazkii</a></strong></li>\n<li>License: <strong>Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 3.0 Unported (CC BY-NC-SA 3.0)</strong></li>\n</ul>",
